Day 50 of the Claude Coding Challenge:  Today I built an AI-Powered Adaptive Interview Defense Simulator—an application that goes beyond resume optimization.



Instead of rewriting your resume, it challenges every claim you've made, just like a real interviewer. Upload your resume or LinkedIn profile, answer a few questions, and Claude generates a complete HTML interview simulator with personalized interview rounds and a detailed Defense Report.



This project reinforced how AI can transform interview preparation from passive practice into an interactive, personalized coaching experience.



